  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Quotas",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Drones</strong>, tap <strong>Quotas</strong>, then <strong>New quota</strong>. The team needs a corridor first.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c4acff1a26bada0d.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Who may ask",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Type the asker's callsign under <strong>Who may ask</strong>, or tap <strong>Pick</strong> for a whole unit.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/61ccadb44238d429.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Team that flies",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Under <strong>Team that flies</strong>, tap <strong>Pick</strong>. Open <strong>1J</strong>, then tap <strong>2R</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9a821707c70750f2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set the numbers",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Set <strong>Requests a day</strong> with <strong>−</strong> and <strong>+</strong>, and change <strong>Valid from</strong> and <strong>Valid until</strong> if needed. Tap <strong>Send</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c59e2b0729c4ead4.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See it live",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The quota is live, so 2R/1J now comes first when ALPHA-1 asks for a drone. The row counts the requests used today.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/813b0bd0e0f299ef.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "If the team has no corridor",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>If the team has no corridor, <strong>Send</strong> says so and sends nothing. <strong>Draw corridor</strong> draws one and brings you back to the quota.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2c5169dcc70a033f.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
